00:37:54.180 --> 00:37:58.710
AI HSM is our first party
security ASIC that acts

00:37:58.710 --> 00:38:02.520
as a secure hardware
backed no local key vault.

00:38:02.520 --> 00:38:05.370
Customers can use this
